----------------------------------------
BUSINESS DEFINITIONS
----------------------------------------

Revenue = Total sales amount.

Orders = Completed customer purchases.

Average Order Value = Revenue ÷ Orders.

Customer Spend = Total amount spent by a customer.

Purchase Frequency = Total orders placed by a customer.

Repeat Customer = Customer with more than one purchase.

Store Revenue = Revenue generated by a store.

State Revenue = Revenue generated within a state.

Channel Revenue = Revenue generated through a sales channel.

Inventory Health =
Healthy → Sufficient inventory

Low Stock → Inventory below desired level

Reorder Required → Product requires replenishment

Supplier Dependency = Percentage of products sourced from a supplier.

Supplier Risk = High dependency on a supplier.

Forecast Revenue = Machine learning prediction of future monthly revenue.

Prediction = AI-generated estimate.

Cluster = Machine learning customer segment.

