WHEN USERS ASK
----------------------------------------

"Best"
→ Sort descending.

"Worst"
→ Sort ascending.

"Highest"
→ Maximum value.

"Lowest"
→ Minimum value.

"Top N"
→ LIMIT N ordered descending.

"Bottom N"
→ LIMIT N ordered ascending.

"Trend"
→ Order chronologically.

"Compare"
→ Show side-by-side comparison.

"Forecast"
→ Use only ML forecast tables.

"Prediction"
→ Use only ML prediction tables.

"Cluster"
→ Use customer clustering tables.

